  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Request for financial support to the 7th United Nations Environment Assembly (UNEA-7)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to support UNEP in the organisation of UNEA-7, earmarked for the participation of LDCs. The funding will cover the costs of economy class flight tickets and daily subsistence allowances for two delegates from each LDC. This participation will serve to advance an inclusive dialogue towards addressing the global planetary crises, while adopting resolutions that catalyse climate actions. This is linked to the Denmark &#x2013; Kenya partnership for the period 2021-2025, Denmark&#x2019;s Strategy for Africa (2024) and Denmark&#x2019;s Strategy for Development Cooperation (2025). These strategies aspire to raise global climate ambitions and drive adaptation, resilience and green transformation. The request for financial support is assessed as highly relevant due to the Danish EU Presidency, Danish VIP participation at UNEA-7 as well as Denmark&#x2019;s leadership in the global climate agenda. Last time Denmark supported UNEA, was during UNEA1 in 2014.</narrative>
  </description>
